---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

import SiteNavigation from "@components/layout/SiteNavigation.astro";
import Panel from "@components/primitives/Panel.astro";
---

<BaseLayout 
    title="colophon" 
    description="colophon">
    <Panel 
        as="section" 
        class="about-colophon" 
        title="About the website">
        <div class="about-colophon__body">
            This website is still under construction and is always being
            maintained. <br>
            I started working on it during the autumn and winter of
            2025. I had wanted to create my own website for several years, but I
            had never really made the time for it. <br>
            For a while, I tried building it with Hugo and Jekyll, but I felt more comfortable using Astro,
            which is what the website is built with now. I also managed to
            deploy the website on Neocities for a while, but I eventually moved
            it to Cloudflare. <br>
            I considered using GitHub Pages, but I am still
            slightly embarrassed to show my code. It has improved over time, but
            my early commit history is a mess and does not always make much sense. 
            (￣▽￣*)ゞ <br>
            By the time you read this, it may be a little more
            organised and understandable. Perhaps I will make the website open
            source one day. Before that, I would like to make sure that all its
            pages work properly with the current design. <br>
            Here, I will gradually write about how I created this website, along with small tutorials,
            useful tips, references, and other notes from the process. Some of
            them may be helpful to anyone interested in using Astro to build a
            static website like this one. (＃￣ω￣)
        </div>
    </Panel>

    <SiteNavigation slot="sidebar" />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    /* Scoped Panel heading override */
    .about-colophon {
        padding: 0;
    }

    .about-colophon > :global(.panel__heading) {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0.82rem var(--space-md);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .about-colophon__body {
        padding: 0.82rem var(--space-md);
    }
    /* Scoped Panel heading override */
</style>